ise.","Greitai ataugs, pažadu.","e9ff0c8dd598",2.19],[0,"Let me take ten dollars off.","Nuimsiu dešimt dolerių.","d6bbf5bab20d",1.87],[0,"That'll be thirty dollars.","Iš viso 30 $.","9a351e031a44",1.38],[-1,"This is for you.","Tai Jums.",1],[0,"Aw, thank you so much!","Oi, labai ačiū!","26166c14fb4a",1.81],[0,"Thanks for coming in!","Ačiū, kad užsukote!","f42391f692b6",1.06],[0,"Have a great weekend!","Puikaus savaitgalio!","e1e7bb21709f",1.28],[0,"Welcome to Snip & Style!","Sveiki atvykę į „Snip & Style“!","2fcf81e83a02",1.85],[0,"Do you have an appointment?","Ar esate užsiregistravęs?","0f81210e8402",1.16],[0,"Got it! You're all checked in.","Supratau! Jūs užregistruotas.","cbeb7b452ca1",1.94],[-1,"I'd like a haircut.","Norėčiau nusikirpti.",1],[0,"Sure! What did you have in mind?","Žinoma! Ką turėjote omenyje?","5649d30ff541",1.65],[-1,"Just a trim, please.","Tik truputį patrumpinti, prašau.",1],[0,"Easy!","Lengva!","09595bfc2297",1.4],[0,"And how much are we taking off?","O kiek nukirpsime?","595b9855a5e7",1.6],[-1,"Take a little off the sides.","Truputį nukirpkite šonus.",1],[0,"Sure, a little off the sides.","Žinoma, truputį nuo šonų.","43bddda1b17a",1.48],[0,"Got it.","Supratau.","feadae2a192e",0.47],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"No problem, I'll just spray it with water.","Jokių problemų, tiesiog apipurkšiu plaukus vandeniu.","fb3e1804df96",1.95],[0,"My cat learned how to open the fridge!","Mano katė išmoko atidaryti šaldytuvą!","88c1424456ed",2.92],[-1,"That's so funny!","Kaip juokinga!",1],[0,"Should I blow-dry it?","Ar išdžiovinti plaukus fenu?","17ec97e33535",1.03],[-1,"With some waves, please.","Su bangelėmis, prašau.",1],[0,"Perfect.","Puiku.","261b527ede65",1],[0,"Okay, take a look! Do you like it?","Gerai, pažiūrėkite! Ar patinka?","5bffb26ac888",2],[0,"Oh… I think I took off a bit more than we said.","O… Atrodo, nukirpau truputį daugiau, nei sutarėme.","a1d45585fbdc",4.44],[-1,"I love it!","Man labai patinka!",1],[0,"Aw, you're so sweet!","Oi, Jūs toks mielas!","1d145cc74235",2.44],[0,"That'll be forty dollars.","Iš viso 40 $.","e276880bdc9b",1.51],[-1,"Can I pay by card?","Ar galiu sumokėti kortele?",1],[0,"Just tap here. The screen will ask about a tip.","Tiesiog pridėkite čia – ekrane galėsite pasirinkti arbatpinigius.","9c28fca9e768",2.71],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"Take care!","Laikykitės!","9c735900b2a8",0.92],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"Great! Can I get your name?","Puiku! Koks Jūsų vardas?","e2c6e4599344",1.68],[0,"So, what are we doing today?","Tai ką šiandien darysime?","5f71e9c26118",1.4],[-1,"Could you trim my bangs?","Ar galėtumėte patrumpinti kirpčiukus?",1],[0,"Sure! Just the bangs.","Žinoma! Tik kirpčiukus.","0ec4e5dd6fef",1.6],[0,"My cat sleeps on my head every night!","Mano katė kiekvieną naktį miega ant mano galvos!","7fb4a430e83c",3.07],[0,"Do you want me to blow-dry it?","Ar išdžiovinti plaukus fenu?","5dbd8f3c9581",1.2],[-1,"Straight, please.","Ištiesinkite, prašau.",1],[0,"You got it!","Bus padaryta!","98e0b1b48dfa",0.91],[-1,"It looks great, thank you!","Atrodo puikiai, ačiū!",1],[0,"It really suits you!","Jums tikrai tinka!","7319206b68d9",1.64],[0,"That'll be twenty dollars.","Iš viso 20 $.","ed059c30d870",1.54],[-1,"Here you go.","Prašom.",1],[0,"And here's your change.","Štai Jūsų grąža.","870064114611",1.29],[0,"Would you like to book your next appointment?","Ar norėtumėte užsirašyti kitam vizitui?","593de39a8bb9",1.67],[-1,"I'm good, thanks. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O Jums?",1],[0,"No problem. Just call us.","Jokių problemų. Tiesiog paskambinkite.","34a7f4f3a47b",1.87],[0,"Me? I'm just hanging out with my cat.","Aš? Tiesiog leisiu laiką su savo kate.","997375dfeba9",2.36],[0,"Enjoy your new look!","Džiaukitės nauja šukuosena!","212b46d91275",1.55],[0,"See you next time!","Iki kito karto!","5f9d1a5e12f3",1.02],[0,"Hi there, welcome in!","Sveiki, prašom užeiti!","ed537ac05e16",1.26],[-1,"I have an appointment at three.",